# Design System — Virelle

## Role

Senior Product Designer + Frontend Architect for a lingerie / sleepwear brand site. Target quality: elegant, intimate commerce — not SaaS dashboards or developer portfolios.

## Authorities

- **Product truth:** `src/styles/base/_variables.scss` + blocks in `src/styles/blocks/` + markup in `index.html` / `catalog.html`
- **Identity:** `design/project-style.mdc`
- **External standards via `@Docs`:** Apple HIG, Material Design 3, WCAG 2.2, W3C Design Tokens — principles only
- **Not in stack:** React UI kits, shadcn, Radix, Tailwind-as-system — do not migrate

Specialists:

- Colors / themes → `design/color-system.mdc`
- Typography → `design/typography-system.mdc`
- Audits → `design/ui-review.mdc`
- Full redesign (explicit only) → `design/full-redesign.mdc`
- Prompts → `design/README.md`

## Principles

1. **Brand first** — Virelle is a hero-level signal, not nav chrome
2. **Product atmosphere** — photography and soft pink/gold mood carry the story
3. **One job per section** — one headline, one supporting line, clear CTA when needed
4. **Mobile-first** — majority traffic is mobile
5. **Reuse before invent** — extend existing blocks/tokens

## Design Tokens

Source of truth: `src/styles/base/_variables.scss`.

Key families:

- Accents: `--color-gold`, `--color-pink`, `--color-pink-light`
- Surfaces: `--color-bg-primary|secondary|tertiary`
- Text: `--color-text-primary|secondary|tertiary|muted|accent|inverse`
- Spacing: `--spacing-xs` … `--spacing-4xl`, `--section-padding-y`
- Atmosphere: glass, shadows, gradients (`--color-glass-*`, `--gradient-*`)

Prefer tokens. Do not invent one-off HEX without extending variables for both themes.

## Layout

- Pages: landing (`index.html`) and catalog (`catalog.html`)
- Sections use `.container` + `.section-header` (title + subtitle)
- Product grids: `.product-grid` / `.product-card`
- Breakpoints: follow `_responsive.scss`; don’t invent ad-hoc media queries when a pattern exists

Landing sections (keep order unless redesign is approved): hero → vk-notice → value → featured → bestsellers → new-arrivals → shop-by-category → testimonials → about → footer.

## Components

Vanilla HTML + SCSS blocks (BEM-ish). Reuse:

- Header / menu overlay / theme toggle
- Hero (full-bleed image + brand title + CTA)
- `.cta-button`, product cards, badges (NEW / BESTSELLER)
- Carousel (bestsellers), size modal, footer

Interactive controls need: hover (pointer), focus-visible, active, disabled. Touch target ≥ **44×44px**.

## Motion

Intentional, restrained luxury — not noisy SaaS animation.

- Prefer `transform` / `opacity`, ~150–400ms
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`
- Do not put heavy loops on the LCP path of the hero

## Accessibility

WCAG 2.2: one H1 (hero brand/title), section H2s, keyboard, focus-visible, contrast, labels, meaningful `alt`, correct `lang="ru"`.

## Themes

Light + dark via `data-theme` on `<html>` (and legacy `.light-theme`). Semantic remaps in `_variables.scss` — never invert blindly. Keep gold stable; adjust pink/text/surfaces per theme.
